        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift\n- Albums: Red\n- Tours: The Red Tour\n- Songs: State of Grace\n- Places: Omaha, Nebraska; Singapore\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift released her fourth studio album, Red, in 2012.\n- Taylor Swift's song \"State of Grace\" appears on her 2012 album Red.\n- The Red Tour was Taylor Swift's third concert tour and supported her fourth studio album, Red.\n- The Red Tour began on March 13, 2013, in Omaha, Nebraska.\n- The Red Tour concluded on June 12, 2014, in Singapore.\n- By June 12, 2014, Taylor Swift had completed The Red Tour, which grossed over $150 million and became the highest-grossing tour of all time by a country artist.",
